{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00221",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.59,
      "end_seconds": 3.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Right, morning, doctor, I hope I'm not interrupting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.95,
      "end_seconds": 9.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.74,
      "end_seconds": 15.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Hmm, doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.27,
      "end_seconds": 19.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.18,
      "end_seconds": 31.48,
      "duration_seconds": 11.3,
      "text": "Honestly, it's severe pain in my right side that comes in waves, and my family pushed me to come. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.11,
      "end_seconds": 35.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.68,
      "end_seconds": 38.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "About... well, two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.37,
      "end_seconds": 46.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind. It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.51,
      "end_seconds": 61.07,
      "duration_seconds": 13.56,
      "text": "Moderate, I'd say. It's a few times a day. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. Oh, and pain moving down to the groin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.67,
      "end_seconds": 63.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.98,
      "end_seconds": 71.23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.25,
      "text": "I'd say severe. Hmm, I've also had blood in the urine, for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.23,
      "end_seconds": 79.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "Have you had severe pain in your right side that comes in waves before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.98,
      "end_seconds": 86.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "I had a similar thing about six months ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.68,
      "end_seconds": 92.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any difficulty passing urine, vomiting or testicular pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.01,
      "end_seconds": 96.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.28,
      "end_seconds": 99.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Any burning when passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.47,
      "end_seconds": 103.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "No. No burning when passing urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.97,
      "end_seconds": 106.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "So, any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.1,
      "end_seconds": 109.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "No, uh, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.91,
      "end_seconds": 113.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.43,
      "end_seconds": 119.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.96,
      "end_seconds": 124.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Alright, moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.7,
      "end_seconds": 130.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Gout, for about a year. I've had high blood pressure, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.1,
      "end_seconds": 132.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.35,
      "end_seconds": 136.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.89,
      "end_seconds": 137.65,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.4,
      "end_seconds": 154.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.26,
      "end_seconds": 157.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.59,
      "end_seconds": 161.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.93,
      "end_seconds": 163.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.55,
      "end_seconds": 164.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.84,
      "end_seconds": 169.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.55,
      "end_seconds": 170.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.67,
      "end_seconds": 174.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.76,
      "end_seconds": 179.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.05,
      "end_seconds": 182.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.7,
      "end_seconds": 186.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.78,
      "end_seconds": 187.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.55,
      "end_seconds": 207.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Okay, what medicines are you taking at the moment? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.87,
      "end_seconds": 210.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "It's ramipril, 5 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 211.12,
      "end_seconds": 219.99,
      "duration_seconds": 8.87,
      "text": "Well, doctor, I think the last prescription for the ramipril was 10 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.64,
      "end_seconds": 223.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.3,
      "end_seconds": 227.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.54,
      "end_seconds": 244.48,
      "duration_seconds": 15.94,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.94,
      "end_seconds": 248.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "I, I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.18,
      "end_seconds": 252.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.65,
      "end_seconds": 256.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.34,
      "end_seconds": 271.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "There's tenderness in the right loin when I tap, and your tummy is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.34,
      "end_seconds": 287.06,
      "duration_seconds": 12.72,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.69,
      "end_seconds": 290.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Right, yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.25,
      "end_seconds": 298.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "Putting it all together, this looks most like a kidney stone. A muscular back pain is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.19,
      "end_seconds": 303.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Oh, I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.55,
      "end_seconds": 320.86,
      "duration_seconds": 16.31,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a kidney stone do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had severe pain in your right side that comes in waves for two days, moderate, and no testicular pain or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.33,
      "end_seconds": 323.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.57,
      "end_seconds": 328.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.31,
      "end_seconds": 330.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.46,
      "end_seconds": 350.29,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Let's get a urine test, for flank pain. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.81,
      "end_seconds": 355.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Oh, alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.53,
      "end_seconds": 382.6,
      "duration_seconds": 26.07,
      "text": "Let's get a CT scan of the kidneys and bladder, for suspected renal colic. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Let's use diclofenac, 50 milligrams, twice a day after food, for three days. You take it by mouth. That's for stone pain. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Let's use tamsulosin, 0.4 milligrams, at night, for two weeks. It's for stone passage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.19,
      "end_seconds": 386.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 388.13,
      "end_seconds": 407.29,
      "duration_seconds": 19.16,
      "text": "Drink three litres of water a day and try to strain your urine so we can catch the stone if it passes. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I'd like you to see the urology team as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.76,
      "end_seconds": 409.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 413.55,
      "end_seconds": 420.25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 421.8,
      "end_seconds": 423.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 424.39,
      "end_seconds": 433.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if you get a fever or can't pass urine at all, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 434.79,
      "end_seconds": 437.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Okay, so yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 438.52,
      "end_seconds": 446.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in a week. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 449.99,
      "end_seconds": 460.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.51,
      "text": "So, I take the diclofenac, 50 milligrams, twice a day after food and take the tamsulosin, 0.4 milligrams, at night. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 461.15,
      "end_seconds": 465.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 466.13,
      "end_seconds": 469.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 470.45,
      "end_seconds": 471.27,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}